---
/**
 * Persistent global WebGL canvases mounted in Base.astro outside `.page` so
 * client-side swaps never unmount or recreate WebGL contexts.
 * Strict fg-then-bg order (canvas[0] z-10 foreground, canvas[1] z-0 background).
 */
---
<canvas aria-hidden="true" class="webgl pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-10 hidden h-full w-full lg:block"></canvas
><canvas aria-hidden="true" class="webgl pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-0 hidden h-full w-full lg:block"></canvas>
